    &lt;figcaption&gt;接著會出現產品列表，找到我們要找的VMware Workstation Pro並點選它&lt;/figcaption&gt;
  &lt;/figure&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure&gt;
    &lt;img src=&#34;https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/4427513/e513f45a-a489-4bd5-b759-e66f61393f37.png&#34; title=&#34;這次我選擇「VMware Workstation Pro 25H2 for Windows」，並選擇發行版「25H2u1」&#34; alt=&#34;圖片.png&#34;  data-zoomable loading=&#34;lazy&#34; /&gt;
    &lt;figcaption&gt;這次我選擇「VMware Workstation Pro 25H2 for Windows」，並選擇發行版「25H2u1」&lt;/figcaption&gt;
  &lt;/figure&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure&gt;
    &lt;img src=&#34;https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/4427513/d9b34939-893f-47e4-815b-442de892816d.png&#34; title=&#34;展開使用條款後，勾選「I agree to the Terms and Conditions」&#34; alt=&#34;圖片.png&#34;  data-zoomable loading=&#34;lazy&#34; /&gt;
    &lt;figcaption&gt;展開使用條款後，勾選「I agree to the Terms and Conditions」&lt;/figcaption&gt;
  &lt;/figure&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure&gt;
    &lt;img src=&#34;https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/4427513/0c4565f5-f808-4d72-bfeb-d83eca1e7529.png&#34; title=&#34;右下方下載按鈕即可點選&#34; alt=&#34;圖片.png&#34;  data-zoomable loading=&#34;lazy&#34; /&gt;
    &lt;figcaption&gt;右下方下載按鈕即可點選&lt;/figcaption&gt;
